config ENTROPY_TLSR8258_RNG
	bool "Telink TLSR8258 ADC noise entropy driver"
	default y
	depends on DT_HAS_TELINK_TLSR8258_RNG_ENABLED
	select ENTROPY_HAS_DRIVER
	select ENTROPY_NEEDS_PRNG
	help
	  Enable the entropy driver of the TLSR8258. It conditions the noise of
	  the SAR ADC and shares the converter with the ADC driver, so
	  entropy_get_entropy() is slow: the random generator takes a seed from
	  it and does not ask it again.
